flowchart TD
  subgraph P[Preparation]
    A[Your reference and learning goal] --> B[Verify course and Mac]
    A --> C[Choose teaching pace]
    B --> D[Choose tiny local model and safe data]
    C --> D
  end
  subgraph I[Implementation and teaching]
    D --> E[Check isolated Python environment]
    E --> F{Small runtime probe passes?}
    D --> G[Text to tokens to next-token targets]
    F -->|Yes| H[Build baseline and causal transformer]
    G --> H
    H --> J[Bounded training and genuine before-after samples]
    J --> K[Independent tests: no future peeking, held-out loss, save and reload]
    K --> L{Checks pass?}
    L -->|One identified fix, at most two retries| H
    F -->|No| X[Save error and exact resume step]
    L -->|Limit or missing dependency| X
    L -->|Yes| M[Working local lesson and verified results]
  end
  M --> N{Publishing access verified?}
  N -->|Yes, after local lesson| O[GitHub source and Cloudflare demo]
  N -->|Not yet| Q[Keep local delivery; record publishing blocker]
